Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters
Given a string, S. Find the length of the longest substring without repeating characters.

Example 1
Input : S = "abcddabac"
Output : 4
Explanation : The answer is "abcd" , with a length of 4.

Example 2
Input : S = "aaabbbccc"
Output : 2
Explanation : The answers are "ab" , "bc". Both have maximum length 2.


Solution:
 public static int LongestSubstring(String s){
  int n=s.length();
  int runner=0;
  int maxLen=0;
  String ans="";
  while(runner<n){
    
    char chk=s.charAt(runner);
    //InValid condition
    if(ans.contains(String.valueOf(chk))){
      ans="";
    }
     //Valid condition
     if(!ans.contains(String.valueOf(chk)) ){
      ans+=s.charAt(runner);
      System.out.println(ans);
      maxLen=Math.max(maxLen,ans.length());
      System.out.println(maxLen);
     }
    
    runner++;
  }
  return maxLen;
 }
